    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d390-a1">

                <pb facs="0428" n="1106" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1106"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure No. 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Mikado’s order</hi> to <hi rendition="#italic">the
                        Prince of Mito.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-05"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >May</hi>, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>As you have been ordered by us to proceed to Kwanto (province round Yedo) for the
                    protection of that province, you will act in regard to the expulsion of
                    foreigners as if you yourself were Tycoon.</p>
                <p>As your ancestors have always, up to the present, acted faithfully towards the
                    Mikados, we expect you will act according to the spirit of your ancestors.</p>
                <p>You will do your utmost, gathering together your adherents, to expel totally the
                    foreigners, and sweep them away as it were with a broom; and you will inform us
                    as soon as possible of the result.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
